{
    "_about": "Golden routing cases (compiled config v1 + scenario -> expected). PHPUnit (RoutingEngineTest) asserts everything. `ranking` and per-location rule/capacity reasons are NEXORA LOGIC that the Rust Functions must also match (Phase 2b adds explicit `allowed_by_line` expectations for cargo test). `outcome` and `shipments` model Shopify's own stock-based choice and are a PHP-side approximation only. Case-insensitive tag matching ('Fragile' vs 'fragile') is UNVERIFIED against Shopify's hasAnyTag; confirm on a dev store before writing Rust. Change expectations only on purpose.",
